BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ab545560-0342-4182-901a-7197d5653834@halfmarathon
DTSTAMP:20260622T212654
DTSTART:20260622T173000
DTEND:20260622T180000
SUMMARY:Wk1 Mon - 1 mi easy shakeout
DESCRIPTION:1 mile easy shakeout - loosen the legs\, fully conversational
 . Optional\; skip if the legs are beat up.\n\nPrehab (2-3x/week): slow c
 alf raises 2-3 x 12 (3 sec up / 3 sec down) + hip/glute work (side-lying
  leg raises\, single-leg sit-to-stands\, step-downs). Helps the Achilles
  + knee adapt.\n\nEffort guide: EASY = can talk in full sentences (HR un
 der ~150). COMFORTABLY-HARD/TEMPO = only a few words at a time (HR ~165-
 175). Stop for any sharp or one-sided pain.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Wk1 Mon - 1 mi easy shakeout
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:85c08fb6-1b4e-420b-b6cf-759d00eea321@halfmarathon
DTSTAMP:20260622T212654
DTSTART:20260625T173000
DTEND:20260625T181500
SUMMARY:Wk1 Thu - 2
DESCRIPTION:2.5 miles easy + 4 strides at the end. Strides = 4 x 20-sec r
 elaxed accelerations\, walk to recover between each.\n\nPrehab (2-3x/wee
 k): slow calf raises 2-3 x 12 (3 sec up / 3 sec down) + hip/glute work (
 side-lying leg raises\, single-leg sit-to-stands\, step-downs). Helps th
 e Achilles + knee adapt.\n\nEffort guide: EASY = can talk in full senten
 ces (HR under ~150). COMFORTABLY-HARD/TEMPO = only a few words at a time
  (HR ~165-175). Stop for any sharp or one-sided pain.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Wk1 Thu - 2
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
