 . Optional\; skip if the legs are beat up.\n\nPrehab (2-3x/week): slow c
 alf raises 2-3 x 12 (3 sec up / 3 sec down) + hip/glute work (side-lying
  leg raises\, single-leg sit-to-stands\, step-downs). Helps the Achilles
  + knee adapt.\n\nEffort guide: EASY = can talk in full sentences (HR un
 der ~150). COMFORTABLY-HARD/TEMPO = only a few words at a time (HR ~165-
 175). Stop for any sharp or one-sided pain.
